description:
Appica's Button. Renders an <a> when given `href:`.

  Button { "Save" }
  Button(variant: :outline, size: :sm) { "Cancel" }
  Button(variant: :soft, icon: true, aria_label: "Bookmark") { bookmark_svg }

Inside a ButtonGroup it takes the group's variant, size, icon and disabled state unless it sets its own (a disabled group always wins).

examples.code:
phlex do
  Button(variant:, size:) { label }
end
